# Bob-omb Battlefield: from the spawn (-398,406, yaw 135) walk the lower
# course to the Chain Chomp pen and on to the foot of the hill.
# The probe spends its first ~70 fields booting, so the route starts at 70.
# DOWN+B heads (+X,-Z); DOWN+LEFT heads +X; DOWN+RIGHT heads -Z.
0 NONE
70 DOWN+B
340 DOWN+LEFT
470 NONE
490 DOWN+RIGHT
720 DOWN+B
840 NONE
